    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the passenger compartment ceiling and wall wash lighting, listing the stowage envelope, the ballast and driver variants and the diffuser and lining details.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the ceiling and wall wash lighting installation for one cabin zone, including the stowage envelope, the ballast or driver, the diffuser and the associated lining and mounting hardware.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is drawn for the left side of one cabin zone; the right side is a mirror image. The lighting standard is identified by the item at position 20: the magnetic and electronic ballast variants are interchangeable at unit level, but the solid state driver is not and requires a full zone conversion. The emergency lighting items on sheet 2 are common to every standard and are unaffected by the conversion."
    },
